{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the boss of your own auto repair center with Car Service Simulator!</strong><br>Realistic repair mechanics, detailed vehicle customization, strategic business management, and an open world full of opportunities await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair, customize, wash, satisfy your customers, and build your car service empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/b829bb79b88957cc8ba78269a0ba1cc6.poster.avif?t=1755268940\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/b829bb79b88957cc8ba78269a0ba1cc6.webm?t=1755268940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/b829bb79b88957cc8ba78269a0ba1cc6.mp4?t=1755268940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Car Repair and Maintenance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skillfully repair systems like the engine, brakes, suspension, and transmission. Use advanced tools to rebuild engines, replace worn parts, and tackle complex breakdowns. Take on bigger, more profitable projects as your skills grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/23fec1bd2b77366e6f89c5f12bb70315.poster.avif?t=1755268940\" width=792 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/23fec1bd2b77366e6f89c5f12bb70315.webm?t=1755268940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/23fec1bd2b77366e6f89c5f12bb70315.mp4?t=1755268940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extensive Customization and Performance Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own paint designs, add body kits and performance parts to enhance both the look and handling of vehicles. Impress clients with custom builds and raise your reputation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/36ebb56f334d85bce84c39978f719293.poster.avif?t=1755268940\" width=792 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/36ebb56f334d85bce84c39978f719293.webm?t=1755268940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/36ebb56f334d85bce84c39978f719293.mp4?t=1755268940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage and Expand Your Auto Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate with clients, set competitive pricing, and invest wisely to grow your business. Use smart strategies in part trading and inventory management to attract more customers and increase profits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Professional Car Wash Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make vehicles shine like new with detailed cleaning and polishing. Use the right tools and cleaning supplies to boost customer satisfaction and unlock additional income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/f9932740d084eb3dabadf9d112f8017b.poster.avif?t=1755268940\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/f9932740d084eb3dabadf9d112f8017b.webm?t=1755268940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/f9932740d084eb3dabadf9d112f8017b.mp4?t=1755268940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Decisions for Success</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to customer complaints, offer tailored solutions, and make decisions that maximize profit. Think like a true business owner!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore an Interactive Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit scrapyards, hunt for rare parts, find market deals, or order premium components online. Build your dream workshop in a world full of endless possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your dream garage and become the best in the industry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Car Service Simulator to your wishlist now and don\u2019t miss this unique experience!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3062160?t=1755268940","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/14ae12397d9fef42762cdb59d94f8e349041e300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755268940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/dfcf6b58669dfc57fb481285d60844ed20bc32ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755268940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/dfcf6b58669dfc57fb481285d60844ed20bc32ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755268940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/42f3b205a38869168901d25724fdf5ee.avif?t=1755268940\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras_big/42f3b205a38869168901d25724fdf5ee.avif?t=1755268940 width=800 height=800 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the boss of your own auto repair center with Car Service Simulator!</strong><br>Realistic repair mechanics, detailed vehicle customization, strategic business management, and an open world full of opportunities await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair, customize, wash, satisfy your customers, and build your car service empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/b829bb79b88957cc8ba78269a0ba1cc6.poster.avif?t=1755268940\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/b829bb79b88957cc8ba78269a0ba1cc6.webm?t=1755268940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/b829bb79b88957cc8ba78269a0ba1cc6.mp4?t=1755268940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Car Repair and Maintenance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skillfully repair systems like the engine, brakes, suspension, and transmission. Use advanced tools to rebuild engines, replace worn parts, and tackle complex breakdowns. Take on bigger, more profitable projects as your skills grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062160/extras/23fec1bd2b77366e6f89c5f12bb70315.poster.avif?t=1755268940\" width=792 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse